The Voyage Hotels mobile app is easy access at any time to everything you expect from a vacation!

By accessing the services and events of Voyage Hotels, you will increase your vacation experience to a higher level.



Using the Voyage Hotels app, you can:

Select in the application the hotel where you stayed;

Receive information about all restaurants, bars, events and exclusive services of Voyage hotels;

Thanks to rich visual materials and a detailed description, to get acquainted in detail with the services provided by the hotel and the opportunities provided;

View posters of daily events, concerts and parties;

Get acquainted in detail with information about restaurants, their opening hours and menus;

Find information about the spa that interests you;

Follow the program of the kids club.

The application works in English, German, Russian and Turkish.

Through the application you can find all the privileges of Voyage Hotels.

Thanks to instant application notifications, you can use all the services and privileges of the hotel on time.

